{"id":18920,"event":{"category":"regular","date":"2025-03-08T18:00:00.000Z","dateStarted":"2025-03-08T19:20:13.624Z","dateCompleted":"2025-03-08T23:35:48.574Z","decklists":false,"description":"Please sign up on our website: https://valhallahobby.com/shop/product/grand-archive-abyssal-heaven-sealed/\nJoin us for our celebration of the launch of Abyssal Heaven, on Saturday, March 8th! Sign-in for the event will begin at 12pm on the day of the event. If you have not signed in by 12:15pm, your seat may be given to a walk-in. Attendance is capped to 16 players.\n\n\nThe entry fee for the event will be $35 (tax included), and cover the packs for sealed + 2 participation packs. Each player will be provided with 4 packs of Mortal Ambition and 4 packs of Abyssal Heaven to build a minimum 30 card main deck and can use any material deck cards pulled, plus the 3 basic spirits and print-and-play AMB draft cards to build a maximum 10 card material deck. We will print any of those cards on demand by players (within reason). The full list of cards we will print can be found here: https://index.gatcg.com/cards?prefix=AMBDP. To avoid bottlenecks, if you have these cards or the ability to print them ahead of time we request that you bring them.\n\n\n\nThe format of the event will be Standard Constructed: Players will play with their built minimum 30-card Main Deck, maximum 10-card Material Deck, and may freely change their decks with any of the remaining cards in their pool between games. Players will play 3 (for 8 or less players) or 4 (for 9+ players) swiss rounds. Rounds will be best of 3. A 60 minute round timer will begin 5 minutes after round pairings are posted.\n\nAt the end of the event each player will receive 2 participation packs of Abyssal Heaven.\nEvent schedule:\n\nRounds may begin earlier if all matches are completed before the end of the 60 minute round timer. This schedule assumes all rounds go to time and that there will be enough players for 4 swiss rounds.\n\n12:0